<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n105853" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῠλίσσω</span></b> , 
			Att.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τυλίγ-ττω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>twist</i> or <i>roll up,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἠλακάτη τὸ ξύλον ἐν ἑ͂ͅ τυλίσσονται τὰ
				ἔρια</span> Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Od.
				6.53
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> metaph.,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἴμας τυλίσσων </span>( 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁδοὺς ἐρευνῶν</span>
			 paraphr.) perh. <i>unravel,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Lyc.
				11
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>bend</i>: aor.
			
				Pass.
			
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐτυλίχθη</span>
			
				v.l. for
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐλυγίχθη</span>
			 in <i><span class="en">
				Theoc.
				23.54
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
